<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεφῡρ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέφυρα</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dam up</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέφυρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεφύρωσεν δέ μιν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ποταμὸν ἡ πτελέη</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.245
			</span></i>; but in Prose, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. τὸν ποταμόν</span>
			<i>throw a bridge over</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.118
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βόσπορον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				88
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς τῆς θαλάττης τροχούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					115c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγεφυρώθη ὁ πόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοίοις τὴν διάβασιν γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.66.6
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>dam</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμοὺς νεκροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					12.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δύσπορα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Demon.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				27.185
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make into a causeway</i> or <i>embankment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεφύρωσεν δὲ κέλευθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.357
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόστον Ἀτρείδαις γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					8(7)
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>.</div>
